./ * HRC244DS - Add support for most of HNDIO from VM/ESA
./ *
./ * Modify  the I/O First-Level Interrupt Handler to add
./ * support for the HNDIO macro and its enhanced features
./ * for user-defined Second-Level Interrupt Handlers. The 
./ * changes to this module include:
./ *
./ * -- Make use of the new DEVSECT macro when accessing
./ *    both the table of user-defined interrupt handlers
./ *    as well as the entries in the DEVTAB table.
./ *
./ * -- For interrupt handlers declared using the HNDIO
./ *    macro, the invocation linkage is enhanced to:
./ *    >> Set R5 to zero since INTBLOK is not supported
./ *    >> Set R6 to the UWORD declared on the HNDIO macro
./ *    >> Set R12 to the handler entry point (same as R15)
./ *    >> Set R13 to point to an 18 word save area  
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITES:
./ * none
./ *
./ * HISTORY:
./ * 22-Mar-2026 WDENTON  Initial version for VM370CE V1 R1.2
./ *
./ I 00136000 $ 00136100
         USING DEVSECT,R9     Address User-Defined-Table       HRC244DS 00136100
./ R 00138000 $ 00138100 100
SRCHU    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00138100
         CH    R4,DEVADDR     Does device addr match in table? HRC244DS 00138200
./ I 00140000 $ 00140100 100
         DROP  R9             Done w/user-defined tbl for now  HRC244DS 00140100
*                                                              HRC244DS 00140200
         USING DEVSECT,R5     Switch to DEVTAB                 HRC244DS 00140300
./ R 00142000 $ 00142100 100
SRCH2    DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00142100
         CH    R4,DEVADDR     Is this the interrupting device? HRC244DS 00142200
./ I 00146000 $ 00146100
         DROP  R5             Done wiith DEVTAB for now        HRC244DS 00146100
./ R 00149000 $ 00149100 100
         USING DEVSECT,R9     Switch back to user-defined tbl  HRC244DS 00149100
FOUNDU   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00149200
         L     R15,DEVSLIH    2nd-lvl interrupt handler to R15 HRC244DS 00149300
./ R 00156000 00162000 $ 00155500 1000
         STM   R0,R1,DEVIOPSW     Save interrupted PSW         HRC244DS 00155500
         STM   R2,R3,DEVCSW       and CSW in the table         HRC244DS 00156500
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVASAP    Are we handling now?         HRC244DS 00157500
         BO    CALLUINT           ..yes, call handler now      HRC244DS 00158500
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVPSDOW   Expecting thie interrupt?    HRC244DS 00159500
         BO    CALLUINT           ..yes, then call the handler HRC244DS 00160500
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVINTR    ..no, show interrupt recvd   HRC244DS 00161500
         NI    DEVFLAG,255-DEVINTP       but not yet processed HRC244DS 00162500
./ R 00164000 $ 00163550 100
*                                                              HRC244DS 00163550
CALLUINT DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00163650
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVHNDIO   Is this HNDINT or HNDIO?     HRC244DS 00163750
         BNO   BALR14             HNDINT takes legacy path     HRC244DS 00163850
         SR    R5,R5              No INTBLOK for VM/CE         HRC244DS 00163950
         L     R6,DEVUWORD        R6 = UWORD                   HRC244DS 00164050
         LA    R13,IOSAVE2        R13 -> handler save area     HRC244DS 00164150
         LA    R14,GO             Return to GO below           HRC244DS 00164250
         LR    R12,R15            HNDIO passes R12             HRC244DS 00164350
         BR    R15                and go to the handler        HRC244DS 00164450
         DROP  R9                 Done w/user-defined table    HRC244DS 00164550
*                                                              HRC244DS 00164650
./ R 00166000 $ 00166100 100
         USING DEVSECT,R5     Switch back to DEVTAB            HRC244DS 00166100
FOUNDR   DS    0H                                              HRC244DS 00166200
         L     R15,DEVSLIH    2nd-lvl interrupt handler to R15 HRC244DS 00166300
./ R 00183000 $ 00183100
         TM    DEVFLAG,DEVPSDOW   Were we waiting for this int HRC244DS 00183100
./ R 00188000 00189000 $ 00188020 1000
         NI    DEVFLAG,255-DEVPSDOW-DEVINTR-DEVINTP Clr stat   HRC244DS 00188020
         MVC   0(4,R6),DEVNAME Save name of interrupting dev   HRc244DS 00189020
./ R 00195300 $ 00195310
         C     R8,DEVSLIH    Does int rtn exist for this dev?  HRC244DS 00195310
./ R 00195700 $ 00195710
         OI    DEVFLAG,DEVINTR+DEVINTP  Mark it rec'd & proc'd HRc244DS 00195710
./ D 00249000 00254000
./ D 00258000 00263000